            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nYes, this is indeed intended: any file operation which can override currently present path is silently ignored. This includes creating a file with the already present name, copy/move/rename other file which results in the same situation. To override, first delete file you want to override, and then perform an operation.\r\n\r\nI'll see if making this an error is a good idea.",
